<title>USA: New York coal/ore/scrap fixtures - October 2.</title>
<headline>New York coal/ore/scrap fixtures - October 2.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>COAL - Jasper 70,000 long tons Richards Bay/Dunkirk or Le Havre 15-30/10 $6.50 scale load/25,000 Cetragpa.</p>
<p>IRON ORE - TBN 160,000 long tons Ponta Da Madeira/Rotterdam 20/10-5/11 $4.55 six days Rohstoffhandel.</p>
<p>-- New York Commodity Desk, +1 212-859-1640</p>
</text>
